window.products.push({"id":468181,"name":"PABIPABI 160LED 68FT WiFi Smart RGB Color Changing APP Control Alexa & Google Assistant Fairy String Lights with Remote for Christmas Tree Bedroom Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uYgFKi6xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄【SMART LIFE APP WIFI】🎄 Download ’SMART LIFE‘ from the Apple Store or Google Play through WIFI. 18 different lighting programs, ten pure color, eight dual color, five tricolor, and two 4-color to choose from. There is a special color wheel for pure color which can be adjusted any single color shade. The brightness also can be adjuste from 0%-100%. The timer function is also essential. This smart light string will definitely make you fall in love with it. 🎄【ALEXA & GOOGLE ASSISTANT】🎄 After SMART LIFE APP is connected to this RGB lights, it can be connected to your ALEXA or GOOGLE ASSISTANT account by setting, and then you can VIOCE CONTROL the light on/off through the smart device, and changing single color. This must be a good-value Christmas string lights. 🎄【FOUR CONTROL METHODS】🎄 1. APP-comprehensive control method. 2. Control BOX-simple control method. 3. RF Remote-portable control method (effective distance is about 50 ft ). 4. VOICE-Voice control via ALEXA or GOOGLE ASSISTANT. 🎄【SUPER BRIGHT LED BEADS】🎄160 LEDs super bright big lamp beads, three-wire parallel is more sturdy and prolongs the using life. LED spacing: 3.9’’, lighted length: 620’’ (52ft), the control box to 1st LED bead: 60’’ (5ft), the control box to the transformer: 138’’ (11.5ft). The total length is 68ft. UL certified 6V 9W transformer which is safe and reliable for adults and children. *Note: It is normal that the last LED bead has about 3.9'' short wire. 🎄【18 DIFFERENT PROGRAMS】🎄Steady, Glow, Overlay, Stack, Updown, Chase, Snake, Sparkle, Twinkle, Fade, Wave, Bubbly, Falling, Fireworks, Jump, Blending, Rainbow, Carnival. Do you want to try this Color Changing String Lights？ 🎄【INDICATOR BUTTON】🎄The button on the left can switch programs and is also a wifi indicator, waiting for connection-flashing red, connecting-flashing green, successful connection-steady green . The button on the right can switch colors. If the TIMER FUNCTION is active (setting by smart life app), the right button on the controller in white. 🎄【POWER OFF MEMORY】🎄There is power off memory function, if you set the mode “snake\", this strand lights will remain on that mode if you power the strip off and on again and inmmediataly resume. 🎄【EASY STORAGE SPOOL】🎄With a spool for easy storage. When not in use, use the spool to store it in the color box, and can continue to use it next year, which is convenient and simple. 🎄【WATERPROOF INDOOR & OUTDOOR】🎄 The product is waterproof as a whole and can be used indoors or outdoors, but please do not soak in water. 🎄【PABIPABI TIPS】🎄 Before using, please test the string lights. If for any reason you are not satisfied, please contact Amazon Customer Service or let us know, we will help you RETURN OR REFUND.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uYgFKi6xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PABIPABI","source_asin":"B099S16CP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099S16CP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099S16CP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
