window.products.push({"id":468220,"name":"SAKIAO 1000 Thread Count Luxury Heavy Cotton Sheets,100% Egyptian Cotton Sheets Queen Bed Sheet Set,Very Smooth Soft & Thick Sateen Weave Fits Mattres","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o8U2kFKZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ UPGRADE YOUR BED LINENS WITH LUXURY IN EVERY THREAD: Wrap yourself in these 100% cotton sheets that give comfort like world class hotel suits. Experience the luxury and silky-soft feel brought together by 1000 threads woven per square inch with our premium egyptian cotton like sheets. ✔ PERFECT FITTING THE COTTON SHEET SET INCLUDES DEEP POCKET FITTED SHEETS: Using high-quality all-around elastic material science. The fitted sheet is equipped with superb all around elastic for a tight fit. Sleep without any worry of bunched up bedding on our snugly fitting bottom sheet. ✔ QUEEN SIZE LUXURY 4PC BED SHEETS SET：Get the feeling of sleeping on luscious, thick clouds with our rich, high thread count sheet set.The head/foot side indicator tells you how to make the bed easily. WHAT'S INCLUDE: Each Queen Size Sheet Set comes with 1× Fitted Sheet 60\"×80\"×16\" + 1× Flat Sheet 90\"×102\"+2× Pillowcases 20\"×30\". ✔ HIGH QUALITY & CRAFTSMANSHIP DELIVERED WITH EVERY SHEET：All our sheets are STANDARD 100 certified by OEKO‐TEX.​ Our bed sheets are machine washable and get softer over time. giving you a lifetime of comfort in just one buy. ✔ BUY RISK FREE! SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We are super confident in the quality and comfort of our product that we offer a 100% satisfaction guarantee! If for any reason you don't love our bedsheets, you can return them within 30 days for a full refund as per Amazon guidelines.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o8U2kFKZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAKIAO","source_asin":"B09ZL8RS9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZL8RS9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZL8RS9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":468221,"name":"Bush Furniture Salinas L-Shaped Storage | Study Table with Drawers & Cabinets | Home Office Computer Desk, 60W, Pure White and Shiplap Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31epXt5MViL._AC_.jpg","description":"Whether you're a student, a professional, or someone who simply enjoys working from the comfort of your own home, a well-designed computer desk can make all the difference when it comes to your productivity and comfort. From spacious surfaces that provide ample room for your computer, paperwork, and office supplies to drawers and storage cabinets that help keep your workspace organized and clutter-free, this home office desk is perfect for your storage and working needs. Features: The ergonomic desk is designed to allow you to create a remote work headquarters with space for your computer, phone, printer, and other essential devices while keeping cords and cables secure and out of sight. With a weight capacity of up to 200 pounds, the writing desk of our study desk provides a sturdy and reliable surface for you to work on, even when you have multiple materials and supplies within reach. The home office desk also features a box drawer for pens, paper, and other office supplies, as well as a file drawer that glides on smoothly for easy access to letter-sized documents. The executive office desk boasts a stylish and functional design with your choice of attractive finishes, tapered leg accents, and contemporary metal hardware that will complement your current decor. Tested to meet ANSI/SOHO quality standards for safety and performance, this L shaped desk with storage is backed by the Bush Furniture 6 Year Manufacturer's Warranty. Made in America with U.S. and imported parts, this desk is a durable and reliable addition to any home office. To enhance your storage and display capacity, add the coordinating Hutch (sold separately), and explore the full Somerset Collection for additional items to complete your workspace.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31epXt5MViL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B0799DQZBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0799DQZBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0799DQZBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":468222,"name":"Korvon Knife & Tool Sharpener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-ynWF9YdL._AC_SL1125_.jpg","description":"The Korvon professional knife and tool sharpener can sharpen almost anything that needs sharpening. The CX7 Tungsten carbide is one of the most durable and effective sharpening alloys available with a hardness of about 9. The hardness scale is based on a diamond being a 10. The Korvon knife and tool sharpener sharpens anything from pocket knives, kitchen knives, garden tools, scissors, mower blades and everything in-between. The CX7 is lightweight and portable so you can have your knives and tools factory sharp all the time. If it's not Korvon, it's not sharp.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-ynWF9YdL._AC_SL1125_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adventure Knives","source_asin":"B01L54H95S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L54H95S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L54H95S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
