window.products.push({"id":468228,"name":"GUYUSO Artificial Monstera deliciosa Plant 43'' Faux Monstera Tree Fake Monstera Tree for Home Office Store Garden Decoration (1 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+itwqBjTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The artificial monstera tree is made of environmental PE and fabric and sturdy wire inside,No smell, no watering.and No fade when the tree is put in indoor house,and safe for babies and pets. The monstera tree is 43'’ overall high,31’’ top wide ,base with a straight black plastic pot in 6.8’’ dia ,5.7’’high.it’s easy to put in a nice bigger planter as desired. The monstera tree is a beautiful accent for your home,Natural green leaves and green trunk. The monstera tree has 11 leaves,it is lifelike and full of vigour. The monstera tree is especially good for hall,living room,bedroom and balcony decoration , to put it on each side of the TV.or to put it next the enter door .which will make a relax feeling. After unpacking the box.please take it out from the carton slowly and bend the flexible branches naturally !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+itwqBjTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUYUSO","source_asin":"B0B6V3PVLH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6V3PVLH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6V3PVLH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":468229,"name":"Set of 12 Stainless Steel Straws, Reusable Metal Drinking Straws, Straight Straws + 2 Cleaning Brushes & Storage Box for 20 OZ Yeti RTIC Tumbler Rambl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j826gM6UL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"18/8 FOOD GRADE STAINLESS STEEL - Comes with 12 straight metal straws(diameter of 1/4''), 2 extra wide boba metal straws(diameter of 1/2''), 2 cleaning brushes, carrying case, perfect for any thick and thin drinks like cocktail, coffee, soda, juices milkshakes, smoothies and boba tea. FIT FOR - These antirust stainless steel straws are perfect for most tumblers like 20oz YETI, RTIC, Ozark Trail etc. It's thin enough to fit the tight outlet of lids. GREAT FOR ANY OCCASION - These metal straws look equally beautiful in a cocktail or a smoothie, which add fun to any party, trendy for family reunion, girls night out,cocktail party, picnics, boating and so on. Also suitable for family party, outdoor picnics, hiking, trips and office use. An exceptional value and an excellent gift for any occasion. 2 LONG NYLON CLEANING BRUSHES - Very handy to rinse off stains. Featuring a stainless steel handle and nylon bristles, the brush is of the perfect size for these straws, also suitable for cleaning cups and bottles. SAVE MONEY - Each reusable straw has the potential to eliminate up to 500 plastic straws over its lifetime. When you purchase a 12 pack of reusable straws, you'll be saving over 6000 disposable straws. That's more money in your pocket and less waste in the landfill.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j826gM6UL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Accmor","source_asin":"B01CXO9AEC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CXO9AEC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CXO9AEC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
