window.products.push({"id":468292,"name":"Scary Peeper - Halloween Animated Decoration Prank with Creepy Face, Knocks on Window - Funny Motion Activated Gag Prop for Haunted House","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419TKHQZiyL._AC_.jpg","description":"High-quality Halloween decoration fit for a scream queenghosts, vampires and Werewolves are scary but what can be more terrifying than a realistic goon knocking on the window as he stares down into your soul? These scary peepers' Are a spectacular addition to any Halloween decor that will leave you trembling with delight.Product Details> high quality latex & fabric construction for professional grade displays motion-sensitive settings: off/on (knocks 3 times every 8 seconds) or motion activated (knocks 3 times when triggered> operates with AAA batteries (not included> can be mounted outside looking in or inside looking outa fright for the senses that will give you chillswhat’s that sound?! it's coming from inside* the house! Scare the pants off anyone, no matter where they are in your home. The knock is loud enough to hear from a distance, giving guests a fearsome surprise when they find the source of this fiendish knocking. No one is safe from the terror these knocking goon props can instill. Naive home-dwellers beware! Scary peepers has a spook with your name on it!a timeless prankthese realistic props are light and portable so you can carry them anywhere you want. Bring them to work or to a friend or relative home—you can even hang it in your car! Easily store them away when your friends have had enough and bring them back out when they least expect it. This holiday gag never gets old.our deluxe Halloween decor is made with high-quality components and built to be durable. Premium latex makes it appear as if this gruesome goon has real skin, and the reflective eyes give him a life-like quality that makes it seem like he's peering back at you when you look at him. One look into these scary peepers and your guests will run screaming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419TKHQZiyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scary Peeper Fright At First Sight","source_asin":"B073G68ZTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073G68ZTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073G68ZTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
