window.products.push({"id":468388,"name":"Curtis Stone Dura-Pan Nonstick 6 qt. Straining Stock Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WA-o9xZcL._AC_.jpg","description":"Get your culinary groove on with Curtis' do-it-all straining pot. With its generous 6qt capacity, it's great for cooking pasta, veggies and more for a crowd. The versatile lid features a convenient, built-in strainer so you don't have to use and clean a colander. The best part? Simply spin the lid to close the strainer for speed cooking. Between the 5-layer nonstick coating and its built-in straining capabilities, this pot makes both cooking and clean up a breeze. That's Curtis for you—eager to please!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WA-o9xZcL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Curtis Stone","source_asin":"B0743NKDYV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0743NKDYV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0743NKDYV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":468389,"name":"MacSports Air Bed Mattress, Twin Size | Includes Air Pump, Inflatable in Under 30 Seconds, for Adults and Kids, for Camping and Guests, Portable with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nZT6SVTcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"That Mac Sports Air Bed Mattresses now comes in a easy to inflate twin size inflatable mattress. MacSports has been synonymous with quality and recognition in the air mattress area since its start in 1993. For years we have been providing campers, home owners and outdoor adventurers with solid heavy duty portable mattresses. The steel frame has a full weight capacity of 250 pounds (lbs) and measures 73 L x 39 W x 23 H that equates to over 6 Feet in length to accommodate even the tallest campers. The blow up mattress for adults is made from a 7\" inch thick vinyl mattress made specifically for camping and the outdoors. The sleeping bed includes a built in AC powered electric air pump for a quick and hassle free inflation and deflation that allows you to set up in under 20 seconds. Our single twin air beds are compact and portable to fold completely and have the folding frame be completely collapsible. The inflatable bed fits perfectly in any tent, cot, pad, or guest room. The mattress does come with its own storage bag for the frame and the bed. Inflating the mattress is pretty simple, remove everything from the box, unpack the bed and plug in the air pump, use one of the 3 plugs that fit your mattress, snug it in place, press the on button and wait for 20 seconds. The Mattress should inflate without any further help from you, fill up until the firmness is at what you would like it to be. The mattress is very comfortable for multiple kids to be sleeping or multiple persons. This folding air bed does blowup in less than 30 seconds and the mattress deflates in around 1 minute. Product Specs Folded: 8. 5 L x 8. 5 W x 37 H Unfolded: 73 L x 37 W x 23 H Mattress by itself: 73 L x 37 W x 6 H Weight Capacity: 250 lbs Weight: 21 lbs Included Items Mac Sports Air Mattress (Twin) (1) AC Powered Air Pump 3 Air Adapters (1) Mattress Storage Bag 1 Year Limited Mac Sports","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nZT6SVTcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MacSports","source_asin":"B07H54C2DF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H54C2DF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H54C2DF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
