window.products.push({"id":468768,"name":"20 / 10 OZ - 2 Replacement Lids for Yeti Tumblers like Yeti Lids - 3.3 Inch Diameter - Spill Proof Lids for Yeti Tumblers - Tumbler Lid for Yeti Tumbl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811dtSVrlbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🚱 LEAK PROOF: With our pack of 2 tumbler lids for Yeti, spilling is not an option. Created with a tighter clasp, so you don't need to stress over spills and leaks, particularly while filling hot beverages or driving. Our Pack of 2 - 20 oz lids for yeti rambler is compatible with tumblers from all known names - Yeti Cup, Ozark, old RTIC and others. ✅ EASY TO FIT: If you are apprehensive that this 3.3-inch diameter lid for yeti will fit perfectly to your Pack of 2, 20 oz tumbler, then worry not. Measure the internal distance across and external breadth of the cup for the lid for Yeti to cover your tumbler flawlessly and protect your drinks with insulated rings from any spillage. 🌡️ MAINTAINS TEMPERATURE: Enjoy your favorite beverage, hot or cold, with airtight 20oz tumbler lid for Yeti that support your beverage's temperature due to its double sealing technology. Also, the cup lid for yeti has a single airhole behind the flap that’s good for splash prevention 💯 SUPERIOR QUALITY: To be used for a long time, our top replacement lids for yeti made with top-notch materials and are BPA-free making it non-poisonous, robust and sturdy. ✨ EASY TO CLEAN: The lid for yeti rambler is dishwasher-safe; the black flap can be bent backwards so that you can clean underneath. It also has a contoured lip for direct tasting or drinking with a straw option. This also allows easy cleaning of the lid for yeti after every use and is very hygienic than other cup lid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811dtSVrlbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C&Berg","source_asin":"B09TGKVTTX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TGKVTTX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TGKVTTX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
