window.products.push({"id":468855,"name":"Hirt's Gardens Cherry Tomato 4-Plant Collection, Sun Sugar/Sweet Million/White Cherry/Husky Cherry Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713LBhULCsL._AC_SL1004_.jpg","description":"Tomatoes are rich in vitamins and antioxidants and the seeds are high in fiber. The green parts are mildly poisonous, which is not surprising, as tomatoes are closely related to both nightshade and tobacco. The tomato was originally believed to be poisonous when introduced into Europe and was used solely as an ornamental plant during the 16th and 17th centuries. The first traces of its use as a food date back to the first half of the 18th century. Tomatoes are now a tasty ingredient in many dishes and are used fresh, canned, stewed or even sun-dried. Sunsugar - Golden yellow beauty achieves a new level of sugar-sweetness and flavor, superb texture and a tangy \"true tomato\" taste. Sweet Million - 1-1 1/2 inch red fruit in grape-like clusters. A truss of these two bite size tomatoes is welcome next to any mixed greens salad. White Cherry - Snow White tomatoes have a sweet, fruity flavor. Hundreds of tomatoes per plant. Husky Cherry Red - Clusters of tasty little cherry tomatoes in a small space over a long period of time. Perfect for pots, too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713LBhULCsL._AC_SL1004_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hirt's Gardens","source_asin":"B00U79QM24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00U79QM24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00U79QM24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
