window.products.push({"id":468872,"name":"Reusable food container silicone bag, 2 Pcs Zip Sandwich Bags, 100% Platinum Silicone Reusable Snack bag, Stand Up Preservation Bag, Convenient to car","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rm56FkOqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of the messy refrigerator and the kitchen? Are you looking for a portable, convenient and practical food bag? This reusable silicone storage bag is designed to meet your space management needs. Enjoy your life with the Xomoo reusable silicone food bag . Why choose us Made from food grade silicone material for safety and environmental protection PVC free and no latex, suitable for adults, infants and young children. Leak-proof and zippered design that not only stores food, but also keeps food fresh. Heat resistant and cold resistant, safe for refrigerators, freezers, microwaves and dishwashers. Convenient, practical and economical, easy to clean and carry. Widely used in storage of food, fruit or vegetables, organizing cosmetics, daily necessities and more, suitable for home or travel. It can be used repeatedly and is more durable and environmentally friendly than ordinary plastic food storage bags. Specifications Product: Reusable silicone food storage bags Material: 100% food platinum silica gel Color: white Packing weight: 1.52 Ib Resistant temperature: -58℉~426℉ ( -50℃~220℃) Package including: 2 × Reusable food storage bags Tips: There might be a little color difference due to the monitor, camera or other factors. If the bag is filled with liquid, the bag should stand upright and do not turn over, otherwise the water will overflow. Do not apply pressure on the bag. Please drain the air before sealing.  If there are any problems after receiving these reusable snack bags for kids, please feel free to contact us and We will process it within 24 hours.The products with the functions shown in the video are for reference only, and the products will be different in the improvement and upgrade. The actual products received shall prevail. Please choose careful.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rm56FkOqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xomoo","source_asin":"B0B9JPZ8JN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468872","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9JPZ8JN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9JPZ8JN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":468873,"name":"Pure Egyptian King Size Cotton Bed Sheets Set (King, 800 Thread Count) Black Bedding and Pillow Cases (4 Pc) – Egyptian Cotton Sheets King Size Bed - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bh8fZsCuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ LUXURIOUS FIVE-STAR HOTEL 100% COTTON SHEET SET: Crafted from 100% Extra Long-Staple Cotton, our sheet sets are softer and more durable for improved plushness. The 800 THREAD COUNT cotton bed sheets are buttery smooth and silky with a rich sateen weave that adds luminous touch to the bedding. These are heavyweight, cooling, and breathable for the ultimate five-star hotel luxury and all-season comfort ✔ WHAT COMES IN THE SET? Our black cotton sheets for king size bed has 4 pieces: 1 Top Flat Sheet (102” W x 108” L), 1 Fitted Bottom Sheet (78” W x 80” L), and 2 King Size Pillowcases (20” W x 40” L). The fitted sheet has deep pockets to fit adjustable mattresses from 8 inches to 17 inches deep. Clever HEAD/FOOT Tags help you to make the bed easily. Pair this Egyptian cotton quality sheets king size with a matching comforter and duvet cover to elevate the home/room decor ✔ SAFE FOR YOU & YOUR FAMILY: Cotton is naturally-sourced and earth-friendly, unlike microfiber and other linens that are not ideal for your health and skin. At Thread Spread, we focus on healthy and quality living, and our luxury sheets are certified as STANDARD 100 BY OEKO-TEX to be free from toxins and harmful chemicals ✔ CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Thread Spread recommends washing the sheets at least once a week. You can either tumble dry or hang the sheets outside to dry. These deep pocket cotton king sheets are resistant to shrinking, fading, and pilling. The fabric opens up in a few washes and becomes softer and smoother. Remove these luxury bed sheets from the dryer as soon as the cycle ends to prevent wrinkles ✔ YOU MATTER THE MOST: We’re confident that you will love our Egyptian cotton quality king size sheets. In case you're unhappy with the purchase, we have a flexible return/refund policy to get the items exchanged or refunded. You can also gift our best Egyptian cotton quality sheets to your loved ones on Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Women’s Day, Men's Day, Christmas, Valentine's Day, Halloween, Weddings, Vacations, and Autumn Holidays","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bh8fZsCuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B084X9DR2N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468873","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084X9DR2N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084X9DR2N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":468874,"name":"Rabbit Wine Corkscrew with Foil Cutter, 1 EA, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oZOwglxNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Effortlessly open each and every bottle of wine! The Original Corkscrew uncorks any size bottle of wine in just three seconds. This wine opener's modern design and superior performance make it an essential addition to any home bar or kitchen. An ergonomic handle adds comfort and control, while durable construction ensures long-term use. This wine opener includes a foil cutter, and an extra non-stick coated spiral. A great gift idea for any wine enthusiast, this corkscrew is a must for all celebrations big or small. Amazon.com Enjoying a glass of fine wine shouldn't begin with fishing out that old souvenir opener from the back of the kitchen drawer. Instead, Metrokane's Rabbit corkscrew offers an intelligent design backed by well-built materials to swiftly and gracefully open any wine bottle. Operation is incredibly simple: just place the neck of the bottle between the two ear-shaped arms, then lift the lever on top and the cork comes right out. Crafted of hardened polycarbonate metal and reinforced nylon, the tool is made to hold up to heavy use, and ergonomic padding on the lever keeps it comfortable. With its smooth, velvety black finish and unique shape, the Rabbit manages to look industrial and sleek-sure to draw attention at social gatherings. The tool also comes with a foil cutter and an extra spiral worm. All pieces are packaged in a padded gift case. Metrokane ensures the corkscrew with a 10-year warranty. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oZOwglxNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rabbit","source_asin":"B00OIT63F0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OIT63F0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OIT63F0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":468875,"name":"LANJILIFE Egg Cooker - Hard Boiled Eggs without the Shell,Silicone Boiled Steamer Eggies, BPA Free, 6PCS/Set Egg Poachers Cooker Silicone Non-stick Eg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JunB3cgNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★Durable & Safe: Includes 6 individual BPA Free, non-stick silicone egg cooking cups, Temperature safe from -40°F to +248°F(-40℃ to +120℃). Thermodynamic design allows eggs to cook just like in the shell. ★ Easy to use & Clean: The egg cooker let you easily make soft, medium, hard boiled eggs, scrambled eggs, mini omelets, salads and more. Crack open the eggs, pour into a cooking cup, boil and serve. These are dishwasher Safe and easy to clean.Note: You need to spray edible oil(non-stick spray,cooking oil or coconut oil) in egg cooker before use for avoiding eggs stuck in the egg cooker. ★Save time: Make your favorite delicious egg dishes and Never Peel a hard-boiled egg again! The egg boiler fits perfectly in any pot. Just put enough water to let them float in it, no need to worry about the pot size. ★Fits for any pot: Egg cooker fits perfectly in any pot. No need to worry about the pot size.Only need enough water to let them float in the water (Recommend using stockpot). Detachable & Handy, you can put 1-6PCS egg cooker in the pot as your needs. Egg cups are NOT INTENDED FOR USE IN THE MICROWAVE. ★TIP: 1, Please use caution when handling as contents will be very hot.Then put it in cold water(about 1 minute), the egg is easier to detachment from the egg cooker.2, The controlled heating temperature, because Intense boiling water can cause the egg cup to sway.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JunB3cgNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANJILIFE","source_asin":"B09FPQ2G94","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FPQ2G94","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FPQ2G94","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":468876,"name":"Crosley Furniture CF6029-WH Tara Hall Tree, Distressed White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":204.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JIekhv4BL._AC_.jpg","description":"Space conscious and stylish, the Crosley Furniture Tara Hall Tree adds much-needed storage to small entryways. The slender profile offers two double prong hooks for hanging coats, hats, and book bags. A spacious lower compartment has a hinged fold-down door with magnetic closure just right for storing shoes at the end of the day. The lower cabinet also creates a seating area or landing zone, making the Tara Hall Tree your go-to for home organization.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JIekhv4BL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crosley Furniture","source_asin":"B09Y8XXXYK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y8XXXYK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y8XXXYK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":468877,"name":"Invisible Versa-Rack – Acrylic Spices Organizer & Utility Rack by Yellow Qube","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sCXgEy-CL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"Clear non-toxic acrylic spice & utility rack is virtually invisible. Great kitchen upgrade, housewarming gift or gift for mom that will add class and pizazz to any home or professional kitchen. Our versatile Versa-Rack can be used in kitchens, bedrooms, hallways and even garages to store spices, spice sets, toys, tools, or just about anything else you want neatly organize or store off of floors or workbenches. The incredible virtually Invisible Versa-Rack is simple and easy to wipe clean. Just use a soft cloth and mild dish detergent. It's also guaranteed for life to never rust, tarnish, peel or turn milky (3-year anti-yellowing guarantee). As to the beautiful design, our designers thoughtfully engineered the height of each Versa-Rack shelf to be just right, so items are as easy to retrieve as they are to replace, yet resistant to falling off the ends. Unique to Versa-Rack, and for added versatility, each shelf comes with inserts that easily slide into and out of shelf ends. The benefit is that, not only do our inserts keep items from falling off shelf ends, but absolutely no messy glue is needed! Versa-Rack is so versatile, shelves can be mounted end-to-end or apart from one another, as the aesthetic design of your home’s space permits. As a spice rack, acrylic is premium FDA food-grade and complies with California Proposition 65, so it's food-safe. As a toy storage shelf, it's safe for children and babies because our acrylic is non-toxic. (Please keep end inserts and parts away from children under 4 years of age due to choking hazard.) As a organizing rack, these shelves will help you get and stay organized. Neatly keep things off floors, garage workbenches, or away from small children. Easy to install in kitchens, bedrooms, closets, hallways, garages – even at the office!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sCXgEy-CL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yellow Qube","source_asin":"B06Y5WCJ22","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y5WCJ22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y5WCJ22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":468878,"name":"Cooling Planet Twin Size Bedsheet Set, 410 TC Pima Cotton, Extra Long Staple Sateen Weave TightFit Elastic Pocket 17\" Wrinkle, Fade Resistant Fitted S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YDvrruunL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Twin Bedsheet Set: This sheet set for twin size bed from Cooling Planet includes 1 flat sheet (66\"x 96\" inch), 1 fitted sheet (39\"x 75\" + 17\" inch) and 1 standard pillowcases (21\"x 30\" inch). Material: These 410 TC bed sheet sets are crafted from premium 100% pima cotton making them resistant to shrinking, wrinkles, pilling and fading and enhancing their longevity. The fabric is made with extra-long staple combed cotton and sateen weave technology to provide extra luxury and comfort to your bedlinen set. Features: Our unique TightFit feature comes with high-quality elastic that fits up to 17 inches deep & ensures you an optimal fit around the mattress. These bedsheets come with convenient head/foot indicators making it easy to identify top/bottom sides of the sheets, ensuring that making the bed is now a hassle-free & time saving activity. The hypoallergenic fabric of our bedding sheets and pillowcases sets are smooth, soft, and breathable to keep you cool during summers and warm during winters. Sustainability Certification MADE IN GREEN By USDA And USPTO: The MADE IN GREEN product label communicates that MADE IN GREEN textiles are not only tested for harmful substances but also sustainably produced in accordance with USDA & USPTO guidelines. That means our textile products are made from organically grown fibres & bio based finishing which makes it unique. We follow a standard quality manufacturing process making hypoallergenic which keeps the moisture away. Wash Care: Cooling Planet’s 410 TC bed sheets are made of extra-long staples that feel soft against the skin. Our bedsheet set is machine washable making them durable for a longer usage. Do not bleach. Warm Iron. Do not dry in direct sunlight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YDvrruunL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooling Planet","source_asin":"B08CC4TK13","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-468878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CC4TK13","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CC4TK13","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
